Check the path in this order:

- `Kbuild` supplies a default and passes the selected number to C.
- `#if` and `#error` reject every value outside 0 and 1.
- Failure point 1 returns `-ECANCELED` directly from init.
- Failure point 0 still returns 0 and uses the normal exit callback on unload.

Do not call the exit callback from failed init; this lesson owns no resource to
release.
